 |A2 = Stick |B2 = Leather |C2 = Stick
 |A3 = Stick |B3 = Stick   |C3 = Stick
 |Output = Item Frame
}}
}}

== Usage ==
=== Showing Items ===
'''Item Frames''' can be placed on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} to showcase an item. Interacting with it opens a menu to insert or take out the item, or remove the item frame.

